  "keyFeatures": [
    "Recruitment pipeline (Kanban board) for tracking candidates through hiring stages",
    "AI-powered candidate-to-job matching and semantic search",
    "Placement and commission tracking with configurable deal splits",
    "Built-in e-signing for offer letters and contracts",
    "Chrome extension for one-click LinkedIn profile capture",
    "Gmail and LinkedIn message sync",
    "Time Off / leave management with approval workflows",
    "Business Development pipeline for tracking client relationships",
    "Talent pools and project shortlists with optional client-portal sharing",
    "Role-based access control with customisable permissions",
    "Bulk CSV import and AI resume parsing",
    "Dashboard analytics with personal, team, and company views",
    "Meeting recording, transcription, and AI summaries via Connekt Notetaker",
    "Mobile app for iOS and Android"
